   "subject": "Dummy mediator simulation using simsem",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Dear lavaan user, <br><br>I hope you are doing well. I&#39;m very new to SEM, currently learning a simulation using simsem package. I have the following population model:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"># Latent variables (normal data)</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\">C1 ~= x1 + x2 + x3</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\">C2 ~= x4 + x5 + x6</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"># Path model (alternative y = C1 + C2 + Z), y is normal</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\">y = C1 + C2 + z1 + z2</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"># Mediator model (alternative Z = C1 + C2), Z is categorical (1,2,3), z1 and z2 are dummies</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\">z1 = C1 + C2</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\">z2 = C1 + C2</div></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\">My question is can I create dummy variables z1 (when Z=1) and z2 (when Z=2) derived from the variable <span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Z, which has original values of 1, 2, and 3?</span></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\">My aim to compare the estimation result from a dummy (z1,z2) vs categorical mediator (Z) variable. Is it possible to do this kind of simulation? Apologize for a very basic question. <br></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\">I use the following code but not exactly what I want:</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><br>library(simsem)<br># Population model<br>popModel &lt;- &quot;<br># Factor loadings<br>C1 =~ 1*x1 + 0.7*x2 + 0.7*x3<br>C2 =~ 1*x4 + 0.7*x5 + 0.7*x6<br><br># Path model<br>y ~ 0.5*C1 + 0.5*C2 + 0.2*z1 + 0.2*z2<br>z1 ~ 0.4*C1 + 0.4*C2<br>z2 ~ 0.4*C1 + 0.4*C2<br>&quot;<br># Discrete data<br>variables &lt;- c(&quot;z1&quot;,&quot;z2&quot;)<br><a href=\"http://pop.th\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://pop.th&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792413779052000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CaVl3UcCOM1A4K9ycQONP\">pop.th</a> &lt;- paste0(variables, &#39; | 0*t1&#39;)<br>pop.mod.ord &lt;- c(popModel, <a href=\"http://pop.th\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://pop.th&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792413779052000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CaVl3UcCOM1A4K9ycQONP\">pop.th</a>)<br>(dat.ord &lt;- generate(model = pop.mod.ord, n = 5000,parameterization = &quot;theta&quot;))<br><br># Test using Lavaan<br>model &lt;- &#39; <br>C1 =~ x1 + x2 + x3<br>C2 =~ x4 + x5 + x6<br><br>y ~ C1 + C2 + z1 + z2<br>z1 ~ C1 + C2<br>z2 ~ C1 + C2<br>&#39;<br># Fit data <br>fit &lt;- sem(model, data = dat.ord)<br>summary(fit, fit.measures=TRUE, standardized=TRUE)</div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:12pt;line-height:inherit;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:black;direction:ltr\"><br><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
